title: 'cumulus-collator: drop extra UMP separators when building signal tail'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Drop any extra `UMP_SEPARATOR` entries after the first separator when splitting a block's
    upward messages, matching `validate_block`. Forward the remaining raw signal bytes unchanged
    unless a `SignedSchedulingInfo` overrides them.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-collator
  bump: patch
